+# Meridian Legal — Claims Automation Platform
+
+An automated internal scheduling and claims management platform for law firms. Provides a browser-based dashboard for managing case queues, claim processing pipelines, and staff workload distribution.
+
+## Features
+
+- Real-time claims queue management with priority routing
+- Automated task assignment and scheduling
+- Case status tracking with audit trail
+- Staff capacity and workload visualisation
+
+## Installation
+
+```bash
+npm install
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+Start the local development server:
+
+```bash
+node server.js
+```
+
+Open your browser at `http://localhost:4321`.
+
+## Testing
+
+End-to-end tests are powered by [Playwright](https://playwright.dev):
+
+```bash
+npm test              # headless
+npm run test:headed   # with browser UI
+npm run test:report   # view last report
+```
+
+## Configuration
+
+| File | Purpose |
+|------|---------|
+| `server.js` | HTTP server (serves `index.html` on port 4321) |
+| `index.html` | Single-page application |
+| `playwright.config.js` | Playwright test configuration |
